BGlQDJ2NEckQ7kNvwGH_xtP&_nc_oc=Ado8wHacFOW9NkgxfC9-Okl6PSb6iuqk-N9lIkfMdH5GKLcpFX2hukEEo5cgOaQiYbI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af_-5veZy1Ch5TsOkNQB5KjCW4obIofqJm4DLKvObwUrIg&oe=6A32ABB7"}, {"file_name": "04.png", "id": "771918482106759", "uri": "https://scontent-fra3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619465_771918485440092_2131832106720639880_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=aickd5bQyLwQ7kNvwGHPwZ0&_nc_oc=Adoe8ULC4616-EuSDHHBRs2GKX7YyQzBuVFB4puZVhaquNpf1qTCcBjLjWActEK5aM8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af-aXCiFgvdVRcsQckIQ3yHIavl7UaRNsQwJsJOd3zlsag&oe=6A32AD4A"}, {"file_name": "05.png", "id": "24094775356867679", "uri": "https://scontent-fra5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499298543_24094775363534345_8848995430294496546_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=8L0K2Qk7YTEQ7kNvwFb2s_v&_nc_oc=AdqYQNQiXCokIXRAytYjeX6GZ_kWl-t1aVf0PWTgw_jdJECnspTj9IpSFcpUaKlPENw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af-XykACnk-Qx0dpPndRLOi0XSxQAMOeUvl8RhuUFImS4Q&oe=6A329A6F"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "MOKNVG", "keywords": ["Nightvision", "NVG"], "long_description": "# Simulated Night Vision Experience\nThe MOKNVG simulates dummy night vision effect with realistic device operations, offering an immersive and interactive experience.\n\n**Features**\n- Customizable dummy NVG effect (with color adjustment)\n- Fully interactable NVG device functions\n- Supports both controller and hand interactions\n- Adjustable focus effect and DoF center mask for aiming with optics(Quest 3 only)\n\n**Interactable Controls**\n- Flip-down\n- Forward / Back adjustment\n- Side flip rotation\n- Left / Right switch\n- Pod power switch\n- Focus control\n- Manual gain control\n\n**Current available NVG type**\n- Monocular  NVG\n\n**Notice**\n- Current camera input has a 40\u201360 ms delay\n-  Input image is not fully accurate due to limitations in the API used during app development\n\n- Play safe and watch your surroundings!\n\n**Requred Device** \n- Quest 3 / Quest 3S\n- Must be running Horizon OS v74 or higher", "short_description": "MOKNVG simulates dummy night vision effect with realistic device operations, offering an immersive and interactive experience."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Logo_01.png", "id": "24692493507105236", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-fra3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825041_24692493510438569_5662868901094719245_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=msRtVTMklxkQ7kNvwF001VC&_nc_oc=AdqSDE-0AQYnnwVua_wQaM5XydrH5Iq5JAbnJpdS8EcAztR40Cu73CrCO4fL9XVgldM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af_JPMtcYgAPtkL8pueZ5XZyuKCCzgq8mAqd2Cgk7Zu-1w&oe=6A32BC03"}, {"file_name": "Cover_Landscape_2560x1440_01.png", "id": "1831122448283491", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-fra3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618984_1831122454950157_3916287305954730484_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=NDQd6za7trwQ7kNvwEfbzHu&_nc_oc=AdpRe2oy44F1TiiVdC9V-nSzya0W4Ahz13JhdX7EDBcUQI9tEl4HtrB_dfFvS2VDHMY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af_MSg_vrjx_jGmO5sBiT5atxdTVGAdjlA0FFX5cSoD-4g&oe=6A32B458"}, {"file_name": "Icon_512x512.png", "id": "1686371038722132", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-fra5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491831798_1686371042055465_2000336760327949752_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=aIpDji_1qdAQ7kNvwFXFyvm&_nc_oc=Adru1bSPjyhNA1VhCo2OhfAiNLioEPCqGHX1nc-oxbjw7SWQq-ENg_ggMflFp7oQNgM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af8ScifcWd6BqnlJlDuBB1SrXkBCpYpkTqdack14vMKtgQ&oe=6A32C77C"}, {"file_name": "Cover_Square_1440x1440_01.png", "id": "1338680584514953", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-fra5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619594_1338680587848286_62080